Abstract = {In this paper the analysis of the classical dynamics of a charged
   particle is carried out without considering that the electromagnetic
   field necessarily goes to zero at infinity. A quite general non-linear
   equation of motion is obtained for an extended charged particle valid
   for any distribution of charge in the particle and for an
   electromagnetic field satisfying any boundary conditions. Some common
   approximations are analyzed with detail to determine how the usual
   difficulties arise.},
