   Birthday, UNIV AUTONOMA METROPOLITANA, IZTAPALAPA, MEXICO, NOV 29-30,
   2000},
Abstract = {The correlation between pressure and the critical temperature of
   high-T-c superconductors is studied. The specific case of the Hg
   cuprates is considered in detail. In a simple model in which overlapping
   of bands increases the electronic density of states, a direct
   description of the increase and saturation of T-c with pressure is
   obtained. Low values of the isotope coefficient are taken into account
   and can be partially explained in this framework.},
