   Univ Paris 06, Observ Oceanol Banyuls, CNRS, F-66650 Banyuls sur Mer, France.
   Univ Nacl Autonoma Mexico, Fac Ciencias, Lab Invertebrados, Mexico City 04510, DF, Mexico.},
ISSN = {0007-4977},
EISSN = {1553-6955},
