   Meeting, BOSTON, MA, NOV 30-DEC 02, 1999},
Organization = {Mat Res Soc},
Abstract = {We simulate a - Si(21-i)N(i) : H that contains 6-atom boat-type rings
   and a - Si(17-i)N(i) : H that contains 5-atom planar rings, where i = 0,
   1 or 4. The simulations were carried out using the DFT-LDA approximation
   contained in the DMol code of MSI. We report calculations of impurity
   levels and relate these to the size of the gap and to the optical
   absorption curves for each cluster. A comparison is made between the two
   a - SiN clusters studied to analyze the effect of the ring topology.},
