Abstract = {We present an analysis of the scientific journals included in the Indice
   de Revistas Mexicanas de Investigacion Cientifica y Tecnologica (Mexican
   Index), which is promoted by the National Council of Science and
   Technology (CONACyT) of Mexico. We put emphasis on the conditions
   established in order to include journals in this new index: original
   contributions in the contents, format, periodicity, distribution
   policies, and organism responsible for the editorial process. We discuss
   also matters concerning finances and the possible merge of journals in
   related research areas, It is concluded that the creation of the Mexican
   Index will help to improve the international impact and visibility of
